# skill-icons: Lucia at level index 40 wearing the Tidal Ring (0x020B4700 = 0xCC). Her Special list shows the
# healer icons and the ring; the name bar reads Cure Water and Crashing Wave as the cursor moves (shots li_*).
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213B9FB 1
poke u16 0x020B4700 0xCC
pin u32 0x020b46c0 40
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
watch u32 0x020B8840 count
watch u32 0x020B8828 cur
watch u32 0x020B883C first
shot li_0
press Down 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 60
shot li_1
